    \textbf{Summary.}~
    In Bangladesh, SMEs spend millions on digital ads without knowing which taka actually
    drives a sale. This briefing introduces the \textbf{Brand Simulation Engine}---a
    revolutionary tool that allows business owners to ``test drive'' their marketing
    campaigns in a virtual environment before spending a single cent. By combining
    advanced AI with local market insights, we help brands move from guessing to knowing,
    ensuring every marketing budget is an investment, not a gamble.
  \end{notebox}

